  "body": "## Disposition\nOriginal unrestricted conjecture remains unsolved, 5/5 substantive turns. Exact circle and fixed-dimensional chart floors, a credited sphere-domain rank floor, and log-free sqrt(n/k) bounds for independent bias-free ReLU and quadratic-on-sphere subclasses are proved and independently reviewed. No arbitrary-activation, general biased/dependent ReLU, or full Gaussian sphere-norm claim.\n\n## Required additive clarification\nTURN_4 section2 uses a deterministic chaining base point e1 and fixed pre-data nets, distinct from the network-dependent empty-pattern vector in section1. ADDITIVE_CHAINING_CLARIFICATION.md is mandatory. The original35 files remain unchanged, with2 separately bound correction files and9 independent review files.\n\n## Verification and credit\n329,914 author and91,084 independent exact controls reproduce, alongside the analytic source/proof audit. Standard-library public replay needs no raw PDFs. BLN and classical tools are credited; novelty is unverified. The raw sources and private imports are excluded. Fresh main is first parent, corrected WIP is second parent. Only this target folder and its own QUEUE status/turn cells change. One draft, no merge or CI-pass claim.",
